{{!-- A d10 drawn with CSS clip-paths on plain spans (0.19.2). It was an inline SVG from 0.18.9,
     but Foundry sanitizes stored chat content and drops <svg>, so the dice rendered as bare
     numbers. Called with n = the face value, or the burned mark. --}}<span class="d10" aria-hidden="true"><span class="d10-line"></span><span class="d10-body"></span><span class="d10-face"></span><span class="d10-num{{#if (gte n 10)}} two{{/if}}">{{n}}</span></span>